 "traditions": [],
 "notes": "Tier shelf. Models come from independent tests: BabyGearLab (carriers; backpack carriers), Babylist (carriers; hip seats), MountainIQ (hiking carriers). Old Ergobaby Omni Classic and Omni Lite dropped (not in any retrieved test; Omni Deluxe/360 kept). Mei tai has only the Infantino Sash Mei Tai: Hoppediz Hop-Tye and others were seen only in search snippets, so left out. No archetypes (tier kinds). No Ergobaby Wikipedia page exists; its register entry cites a 2007 Star-Bulletin article. Tula and Moby register entries leave country blank (not stated on retrieved pages). Hybrid buckle wraps and pre-sewn wraps folded into SSC / stretchy-wrap types, not separate kinds. Traditional carriers (onbuhimo, podaegi, cradleboard) not added as kinds. No traditions."
}